comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-25T15:57:47.833Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status keyword dry-run search returned 205 entries; no open matching schema preview owner exists. Closed custom-type lineage was read in full. Found while reproducing PR 1309 clean-checkout changelog drift."
  "2026-09-25T16:00:09.822Z","harness:codex","TDD regression failed before the patch: schema add-type Preview --dry-run exited 0 and wrote the type. The adapter now refuses unsupported dry-run combinations before SDK dispatch, including shorthand and infer-plus-apply; migration and workflow-policy previews remain supported. The integration fixture snapshots schema files, workspace history and merge attributes and checks a valid rename preview stays read-only."
  "2026-09-25T16:02:36.537Z","harness:codex",The same dropped preview flag also affected the generic SDK/MCP schema action. A second red regression proved remove-type with dryRun=true could delete the type. Moved admission to a shared SDK guard used by both transports; tests cover top-level and nested runtime options and preserve supported read/migration paths.
  "2026-09-25T16:05:57.089Z","harness:codex","Shared-guard verification passes all 185 tests across real CLI/SDK schema acceptance, command registration, schema CRUD and migration suites. ESLint and docstring checks pass; CLI contracts are unchanged and the additive public SDK guard export is recorded in the surface snapshot. A new full-source coverage run is required and currently executing."
  "2026-09-25T16:22:47.595Z","harness:codex","Manual acceptance passed in a disposable workspace using the built CLI and the actual public @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/runtime export. Unsupported CLI add-type and SDK remove-type previews refused; supported rename preview returned applied=false. Byte snapshots of schema files, workspace history and merge attributes stayed unchanged after each preview. The temporary workspace was removed."
  "2026-09-25T16:26:59.473Z","harness:codex","Full-source run executed 9,308 tests: 9,307 passed and one directory-cap contract failed; two platform-specific tests remained skipped. Exact coverage passed with zero uncovered counts: 65,432 statements, 50,009 branches, 13,560 functions and 62,520 lines. Moved the shared guard into the existing sdk/runtime directory to preserve the 120-file cap without changing behavior; focused layout/schema verification follows."
  "2026-09-25T16:28:15.031Z","harness:codex","After relocating the unchanged guard to sdk/runtime, all 15 directory/workflow contracts and both schema integration cases pass. The linked schema verification also passes all 185 tests. SDK surface and CLI contracts, ESLint, docstrings and documentation links pass; exact full-source coverage remains 100/100/100/100. No caps, exclusions or thresholds were weakened."
